unit:BTU_TH-PER-LB
  a qudt:Unit ;
  dcterms:description """${\\bf Btu_{th} / lbm}$, British Thermal Unit (therm.) Per Pound Mass, is a unit in the category of total
    energy per unit mass, commonly known as specific enthalpy. It is also known as Btu per pound, Btu/pound, Btu/lb. This unit is
    commonly used in the UK unit system. British Thermal Unit (therm.) Per Pound Mass (Btu (therm.)/lbm) has a dimension of
