unit:IN-PER-MIN
  a qudt:Unit ;
  dcterms:description """The inch per minute is a unit of speed or velocity. It expresses the distance in inches (in) traveled or
    displaced, divided by time in minutes (min). The equivalent SI unit is the metre per second.
  """ ;
