  dcterms:description """A megabit per second (Mbit/s or Mb/s; not to be confused with mbit/s which means millibit per second, or
    with Mbitps which means megabit picosecond) is a unit of data transfer rate equal to 1,000,000 bits per second or 1,000
    kilobits per second or 125,000 bytes per second or 125 kilobytes per second.
  """^^rdf:HTML ;
