unit:MilliEQ-PER-DeciL
  a qudt:Unit ;
  dcterms:description "Milliequivalent per decilitre is occasionally used in clinical reporting where mass concentrations are also expressed per decilitre. One milliequivalent per decilitre equals ten milliequivalents per litre." ;
